 ["Count every product: many cold and flu tablets contain paracetamol.", "People who weigh under 50 kg, drink heavily, are frail or have liver disease may need lower doses.", "Children’s doses go by weight, not age: use the right strength liquid and an oral syringe.", "Since 2025, pack sizes sold outside pharmacies are smaller to reduce overdoses."],
